        <h1>Staff help centre</h1>
        <p>A practical guide to the staff portal, with extra detail on how to set up assessments, enter marks, save corrections, and understand the administrator approval step.</p>
        <p>Marks affect student reports. Before saving, check the student, class, subject, assessment, score, term, and year carefully.</p>
        <div class="guide-links"><NavLink href="/staff/marks">Open Enter Marks</NavLink><NavLink href="/staff">Open Dashboard</NavLink></div>
    </header>

